发散，根本没有终值。</p></div>
    </div>

    <h4>拉氏逆变换：部分分式法</h4>
    <p>定义式 <span class="m">f(t)=\frac{1}{2\pi j}\int_{\sigma-j\infty}^{\sigma+j\infty}F(s)e^{st}ds</span> 很少直接使用。实际做法是把 <span class="m">F(s)</span> 拆成部分分式，再查表。</p>
    <span class="mb">F(s)=\frac{A(s)}{B(s)}=\frac{b_0s^m+b_1s^{m-1}+\cdots+b_m}{s^n+a_1s^{n-1}+\cdots+a_n}</span>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>极点</strong>：<span class="m">B(s)=0</span> 的根，在 s 平面上用 × 表示。</li>
      <li><strong>零点</strong>：<span class="m">A(s)=0</span> 的根，在 s 平面上用 ○ 表示。</li>
    </ul>
    <h4>情况 1：极点为不相等的实数</h4>
    <span class="mb">F(s)=\frac{K_1}{s-p_1}+\frac{K_2}{s-p_2}+\cdots+\frac{K_n}{s-p_n},\qquad K_i=\left[(s-p_i)F(s)\right]_{s=p_i}</span>
    <span class="mb">f(t)=K_1e^{p_1t}+K_2e^{p_2t}+\cdots+K_ne^{p_nt}</span>
    <h4>情况 2：含共轭复数极点 <span class="m">-\alpha\pm j\beta</span></h4>
    <p>共轭极点对应的系数也互为共轭。设极点 <span class="m">-\alpha+j\beta</span> 的系数为 <span class="m">K_1=A+jB</span>，则：</p>
    <span class="mb">f_c(t)=2e^{-\alpha t}\left[A\cos\beta t-B\sin\beta t\right]=2\sqrt{A^2+B^2}\,e^{-\alpha t}\cos(\beta t+\varphi),\quad \varphi=\arccos\frac{A}{\sqrt{A^2+B^2}}</span>
    <p class="small muted">注：当 B &lt; 0 时，φ 应取负值，即 φ 等于 K₁ 的辐角。这一点为整理者补充。</p>
    <div class="callout key"><span class="label">极其重要（课件原话）</span><p>复数极点的<strong>实部</strong> <span class="m">-\alpha</span> 决定响应<strong>衰减的快慢</strong>，<strong>虚部</strong> <span class="m">\beta</span> 决定<strong>振荡的频率</strong>。</p></div>

    <div class="lab" id="lab-pf">
      <div class="lab-head"><span class="badge">交互</span><b>部分分式计算器（留数法）</b><span class="hint">F(s) = N(s) / [(s − p₁)(s − p₂)…]。可以选课件例题，也可以自己输入分子系数和互不相同的极点，复数写成 −1+2j。</span></div>
      <div class="lab-body">
        <div class="fields">
          <label class="field" for="pfPreset"><span>例题</span><select id="pfPreset"></select></label>
          <label class="field" for="pfNum"><span>分子 N(s) 系数（降幂，逗号分隔）</span><input type="text" id="pfNum" inputmode="decimal"></label>
          <label class="field" for="pfPoles"><span>极点 p₁, p₂, …（逗号分隔）</span><input type="text" id="pfPoles"></label>
        </div>
        <div class="btnrow"><button id="pfGo">计算</button></div>
        <div class="out" id="pfOut" aria-live="polite"></div>
        <div class="plotwrap sm"><canvas id="pfPlot" role="img" aria-label="逆变换结果 f(t) 的曲线"></canvas></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h4>用拉氏变换求解微分方程的步骤</h4>
    <ol class="steps">
      <li>对微分方程两边取拉氏变换，用微分定理时<strong>注意初始条件</strong>。</li>
      <li>整理出输出的象函数 <span class="m">Y(s)</span>。</li>
      <li>代入输入信号的象函数 <span class="m">U(s)</span>，查典型函数表。</li>
      <li>用部分分式法求逆变换，得到 <span class="m">y(t)</span>。</li>
    </ol>
  </section>
  <section class="sec" id="c4-4">
    <h3>4.4 传递函数</h3>
    <blockquote><p><strong>传递函数</strong>：在<strong>零初始条件</strong>下（输出及其各阶导数在 t = 0 时刻都为零），线性定常系统<strong>输出的拉氏变换</strong>与<strong>输入的拉氏变换</strong>之比。</p></blockquote>
    <span class="mb">G(s)=\frac{Y(s)}{U(s)}=\frac{b_ms^m+b_{m-1}s^{m-1}+\cdots+b_0}{a_ns^n+a_{n-1}s^{n-1}+\cdots+a_0}=\frac{N(s)}{D(s)}</span>
    <span class="mb">Y(s)=G(s)U(s)\qquad\Rightarrow\qquad y(t)=L^{-1}\left[G(s)U(s)\right]</span>
    <p>零初始条件下，微分方程和传递函数可以<strong>直接互换</strong>：把 <span class="m">\frac{d^k}{dt^k}</span> 换成 <span class="m">s^k</span> 即可。例如 <span class="m">y''+3y'+2y=u</span> ⇔ <span class="m">G(s)=\frac{1}{s^2+3s+2}</span>。</p>
    <h4>零极点形式</h4>
    <span class="mb">G(s)=k\frac{(s-z_1)(s-z_2)\cdots(s-z_m)}{(s-p_1)(s-p_2)\cdots(s-p_n)}</span>
    <div class="split">
      <div>
        <p><strong>课件例题</strong>：</p>
        <span class="mb left">G(s)=\frac{2s^2-2s-4}{s^3+5s^2+8s+6}=\frac{2(s+1)(s-2)}{(s+3)(s+1+j)(s+1-j)}</span>
        <ul>
          <li>零点：<span class="m">z_1=-1,\ z_2=2</span>（○）</li>
          <li>极点：<span class="m">p_1=-3,\ p_{2,3}=-1\pm j</span>（×）</li>
          <li>极点全部在左半平面，所以<strong>系统稳定</strong>。右半平面的零点 +2 不影响稳定性（课件 P73）。</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <figure style="margin:0"><svg class="splane" id="zpPlot" viewBox="0 0 280 230" role="img" aria-label="s 平面零极点图：极点 −3、−1+j、−1−j 都在左半平面；零点 −1 和 2。"></svg><figcaption class="small muted" style="text-align:center">s 平面零极点图（× 极点，○ 零点）</figcaption></figure>
    </div>
    <h4>极点的物理意义：决定稳定性</h4>
    <p>由部分分式法，响应由 <span class="m">K_ie^{p_it}</span> 这样的项叠加而成：</p>
    <ul>
      <li>极点<strong>全部在左半平面</strong>（实部 &lt; 0）：每一项都随 <span class="m">t\to\infty</span> 衰减为零 → <strong>稳定</strong>。</li>
      <li>只要<strong>有一个极点在右半平面</strong>：对应的项随时间发散 → <strong>不稳定</strong>。</li>
      <li>零点、极点是<strong>系统本身的属性</strong>，与输入无关。<strong>极点起决定性作用</strong>（定性，决定是否稳定），<strong>零点影响响应的形状</strong>（定量）。</li>
    </ul>
    <h4>典型环节</h4>
    <div class="tablewrap"><table>
      <thead><tr><th>环节</th><th>传递函数</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td>比例环节</td><td><span class="m">k</span></td></tr>
        <tr><td>积分环节</td><td><span class="m">\frac{1}{s}</span></td></tr>
        <tr><td>微分环节</td><td><span class="m">s</span></td></tr>
        <tr><td>惯性环节</td><td><span class="m">\frac{1}{Ts+1}</span></td></tr>
        <tr><td>振荡环节</td><td><span class="m">\frac{1}{T^2s^2+2\zeta Ts+1}</span></td></tr>
        <tr><td>一阶微分环节</td><td><span class="m">\tau s+1</span></td></tr>
        <tr><td>二阶微分环节</td><td><span class="m">\tau^2s^2+2\zeta\tau s+1</span></td></tr>
      </tbody></table></div>
  </section>

  <section class="sec" id="c4-5">
    <h3>4.5 结构图（方框图）</h3>
    <p>结构图是数学模型的<strong>图解形式</strong>，既直观又精确。它由四个要素组成：</p>
    <div class="grid2">
      <div class="box"><h5>方块</h5><p>方块内写环节的传递函数</p></div>
      <div class="box"><h5>信号线</h5><p>带箭头，表示信号传递的方向</p></div>
      <div class="box"><h5>引出点（测量点）</h5><p>同一信号分成几路，各路的信号相同</p></div>
      <div class="box"><h5>比较点（综合点）</h5><p>对信号做加、减运算</p></div>
    </div>
    <h4>三种基本变换</h4>
    <div class="box" style="margin-bottom:10px"><div class="k">串联：传递函数相乘</div>
      <div class="diagram narrow"><svg viewBox="0 0 420 60" role="img" aria-label="串联：R(s) 经 G1(s)、G2(s) 得到 C(s)">
        <text x="4" y="37" class="lbl">R(s)</text><line x1="40" y1="32" x2="96" y2="32" class="ln" marker-end="url(#ah)"/>
        <rect x="96" y="14" width="90" height="36" rx="4" class="blk"/><text x="141" y="37" text-anchor="middle" class="bt">G₁(s)</text>
        <line x1="186" y1="32" x2="234" y2="32" class="ln" marker-end="url(#ah)"/>
        <rect x="234" y="14" width="90" height="36" rx="4" class="blk"/><text x="279" y="37" text-anchor="middle" class="bt">G₂(s)</text>
        <line x1="324" y1="32" x2="374" y2="32" class="ln" marker-end="url(#ah)"/><text x="378" y="37" class="lbl">C(s)</text>
      </svg></div>
      <span class="mb">G(s)=G_1(s)G_2(s)</span></div>
    <div class="box" style="margin-bottom:10px"><div class="k">并联：传递函数相加（减）</div>
      <div class="diagram narrow"><svg viewBox="0 0 420 120" role="img" aria-label="并联：R(s) 分别经 G1(s) 和 G2(s) 后在比较点相加或相减得到 C(s)">
        <text x="4" y="65" class="lbl">R(s)</text><line x1="40" y1="60" x2="80" y2="60" class="ln"/><circle cx="80" cy="60" r="3" class="dotp"/>
        <polyline points="80,60 80,28 140,28" class="ln" marker-end="url(#ah)"/><polyline points="80,60 80,92 140,92" class="ln" marker-end="url(#ah)"/>
        <rect x="140" y="10" width="90" height="36" rx="4" class="blk"/><text x="185" y="33" text-anchor="middle" class="bt">G₁(s)</text>
        <rect x="140" y="74" width="90" height="36" rx="4" class="blk"/><text x="185" y="97" text-anchor="middle" class="bt">G₂(s)</text>
        <polyline points="230,28 300,28 300,48" class="ln" marker-end="url(#ah)"/><polyline points="230,92 300,92 300,72" class="ln" marker-end="url(#ah)"/>
        <circle cx="300" cy="60" r="12" class="sum"/><text x="278" y="44" class="sg">+</text><text x="276" y="88" class="sg">±</text>
        <line x1="312" y1="60" x2="374" y2="60" class="ln" marker-end="url(#ah)"/><text x="378" y="65" class="lbl">C(s)</text>
      </svg></div>
      <span class="mb">G(s)=G_1(s)\pm G_2(s)</span></div>
    <div class="box"><div class="k">负反馈：闭环传递函数</div>
      <div class="diagram narrow"><svg viewBox="0 0 420 130" role="img" aria-label="负反馈：R(s) 与反馈信号相减后经 G(s) 得到 C(s)，C(s) 经 H(s) 反馈">
        <text x="4" y="45" class="lbl">R(s)</text><line x1="40" y1="40" x2="88" y2="40" class="ln" marker-end="url(#ah)"/>
        <circle cx="100" cy="40" r="12" class="sum"/><text x="76" y="30" class="sg">+</text><text x="84" y="70" class="sg">−</text>
        <line x1="112" y1="40" x2="170" y2="40" class="ln" marker-end="url(#ah)"/>
        <rect x="170" y="22" width="90" height="36" rx="4" class="blk"/><text x="215" y="45" text-anchor="middle" class="bt">G(s)</text>
        <line x1="260" y1="40" x2="374" y2="40" class="ln" marker-end="url(#ah)"/><text x="378" y="45" class="lbl">C(s)</text>
        <circle cx="330" cy="40" r="3" class="dotp"/><polyline points="330,40 330,100 260,100" class="ln" marker-end="url(#ah)"/>
        <rect x="170" y="82" width="90" height="36" rx="4" class="blk"/><text x="215" y="105" text-anchor="middle" class="bt">H(s)</text>
        <polyline points="170,100 100,100 100,52" class="ln" marker-end="url(#ah)"/>
      </svg></div>
      <span class="mb">\Phi(s)=\frac{C(s)}{R(s)}=\frac{G(s)}{1+G(s)H(s)}=\frac{\text{前向通路传递函数}}{1+\text{开环传递函数}}</span>
      <ul class="small">
        <li><strong>前向通路</strong>：从输入到输出的通路，这里是 <span class="m">G(s)</span>。</li>
        <li><strong>反馈通路</strong>：从输出回到输入的通路，这里是 <span class="m">H(s)</span>。</li>
        <li><strong>开环传递函数</strong> = 前向通路传递函数 × 反馈通路传递函数，即 <span class="m">G(s)H(s)</span>。</li>
        <li>单位负反馈（<span class="m">H=1</span>）时，<span class="m">\Phi(s)=\frac{G(s)}{1+G(s)}</span>。</li>
      </ul>
      <details><summary>推导<span class="src">补充推导</span></summary><div class="dbody"><p><span class="m">C=G\,E</span>，<span class="m">E=R-HC</span> ⇒ <span class="m">C=G(R-HC)</span> ⇒ <span class="m">C(1+GH)=GR</span> ⇒ <span class="m">\frac{C}{R}=\frac{G}{1+GH}</span>。</p></div></details>
    </div>
    <div class="callout key"><span class="label">三类模型相互等价</span><p>微分方程、传递函数、结构图描述的是同一个系统，可以相互转换。化简结构图属于重点内容（课件 P85）。</p></div>
  </section>

  <section class="sec" id="c4-6">
    <h3>控制系统分析：已知模型求输出</h3>
    <p><strong>问题描述</strong>：已知系统的数学模型、输入信号和初始状态，求输出响应 <span class="m">y(t)</span> 以及性能指标。</p>
    <div class="grid2">
      <div class="box"><h5>已知微分方程</h5><ol class="small"><li>拉氏变换（微分定理，注意初值）</li><li>整理出 <span class="m">Y(s)</span></li><li>代入 <span class="m">U(s)</span>（查典型函数表）</li><li>部分分式法 → <span class="m">y(t)</span></li></ol></div>
      <div class="box"><h5>已知传递函数或结构图</h5><ol class="small"><li>求出（闭环）传递函数 <span class="m">G(s)</span></li><li>代入 <span class="m">U(s)</span></li><li><span class="m">Y(s)=G(s)U(s)</span></li><li>拉氏逆变换 → <span class="m">y(t)</span></li></ol></div>
    </div>
    <div class="callout key"><span class="label">稳定性分析（课件 P74）</span><p>求出特征方程（传递函数分母 = 0）的根，即极点。<strong>全部极点实部 &lt; 0 ⇔ 系统稳定。</strong></p></div>

    <h4>二阶系统（课件实验 2）</h4>
    <p>开环传递函数 <span class="m">G(s)=\frac{\omega_n^2}{s^2+2\xi\omega_ns}</span>，单位负反馈后的闭环传递函数为：</p>
    <span class="mb">\Phi(s)=\frac{\omega_n^2}{s^2+2\xi\omega_ns+\omega_n^2},\qquad p_{1,2}=-\xi\omega_n\pm\omega_n\sqrt{\xi^2-1}</span>
    <div class="tablewrap"><table>
      <thead><tr><th>阻尼比 ξ</th><th>类型</th><th>极点</th><th>阶跃响应</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td>ξ &gt; 1</td><td>过阻尼</td><td>两个不相等的负实根</td><td>单调上升，无超调</td></tr>
        <tr><td>ξ = 1</td><td>临界阻尼</td><td>两个相等的负实根</td><td>单调上升，是无超调中最快的</td></tr>
        <tr><td>0 &lt; ξ &lt; 1</td><td>欠阻尼</td><td>一对共轭复根，实部 &lt; 0</td><td>衰减振荡，有超调</td></tr>
        <tr><td>ξ = 0</td><td>无阻尼</td><td>一对纯虚根</td><td>等幅振荡</td></tr>
      </tbody></table></div>
    <p class="small muted">表中“阶跃响应”一列为整理者根据极点位置补充的说明。</p>
    <div class="lab" id="lab-so">
      <div class="lab-head"><span class="badge">交互</span><b>二阶系统：阻尼比 ξ、自然频率 ωn 与阶跃响应</b><span class="hint">拖动滑块，观察极点在 s 平面上怎样移动，以及超调量、调节时间怎样变化。</span></div>
      <div class="lab-body">
        <div class="controls">
          <div class="ctl"><label for="soXi">阻尼比 ξ <output id="soXiV"></output></label><input type="range" id="soXi" min="0" max="2" step="0.01" value="0.4"></div>
          <div class="ctl"><label for="soWn">自然频率 ωn（rad/s） <output id="soWnV"></output></label><input type="range" id="soWn" min="1" max="10" step="0.1" value="2"></div>
          <div class="ctl"><label for="soEps">误差带 ε</label><select id="soEps"><option value="0.05">±5%</option><option value="0.02">±2%</option></select></div>
        </div>
        <div class="split">
          <div><div class="legend"><span><i style="background:var(--s1)"></i>阶跃响应 h(t)</span><span><i class="dash" style="color:var(--muted)"></i>稳态值与误差带</span></div>
            <div class="plotwrap"><canvas id="soPlot" role="img" aria-label="二阶系统单位阶跃响应曲线"></canvas></div></div>
          <figure style="margin:0"><svg class="splane" id="soPlane" viewBox="0 0 280 230" role="img" aria-label="闭环极点在 s 平面上的位置"></svg><figcaption class="small muted" style="text-align:center">闭环极点（×）</figcaption></figure>
        </div>
        <div class="metrics" id="soMetrics"></div>
        <p class="verdict mid" id="soVerdict"></p>
        <p class="small muted">欠阻尼时的理论公式（补充）：<span class="m">\sigma=e^{-\pi\xi/\sqrt{1-\xi^2}}\times100\%</span>，<span class="m">T_m=\frac{\pi}{\omega_n\sqrt{1-\xi^2}}</span>。表中“仿真”值由数值积分得到；横轴随 ωn 自动缩放。</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="sec" id="c4-hw">
    <h3>例题与作业详解</h3>
    <p class="muted">点击展开解题过程。以下答案均已逐一核算，部分题可以用上面的<a href="#lab-pf">部分分式计算器</a>验证。</p>

    <h4>拉氏变换</h4>
    <details><summary><span class="q">作业：求单位脉冲函数、单位阶跃函数、指数函数的拉氏变换</span><span class="src">作业</span></summary><div class="dbody">
      <p><span class="m">L[\delta(t)]=1</span>；<span class="m">L[1(t)]=\frac{1}{s}</span>；<span class="m">L[e^{-at}]=\frac{1}{s+a}</span>。推导见 <a href="#c4-3">4.3 节</a>。</p></div></details>
    <details><summary><span class="q">作业：求 f(t) = 2 + 3t 与 f(t) = e<sup>−2t</sup>（t ≥ 0）的拉氏变换</span><span class="src">作业</span></summary><div class="dbody">
      <p>由线性定理：<span class="m">L[2+3t]=2\cdot\frac{1}{s}+3\cdot\frac{1}{s^2}=\frac{2}{s}+\frac{3}{s^2}=\frac{2s+3}{s^2}</span></p>
      <p><span class="m">L[e^{-2t}]=\frac{1}{s+2}</span></p></div></details>

    <h4>拉氏逆变换</h4>
    <details><summary><span class="q">例 4-8：<span class="m">F(s)=\frac{10(s+2)(s+5)}{s(s+1)(s+3)}</span>，求 f(t)</span><span class="src">例题</span></summary><div class="dbody">
      <span class="mb">F(s)=\frac{K_1}{s}+\frac{K_2}{s+1}+\frac{K_3}{s+3}</span>
      <p><span class="m">K_1=\left.\frac{10(s+2)(s+5)}{(s+1)(s+3)}\right|_{s=0}=\frac{100}{3}</span>，<span class="m">K_2=\left.\frac{10(s+2)(s+5)}{s(s+3)}\right|_{s=-1}=\frac{40}{-2}=-20</span>，<span class="m">K_3=\left.\frac{10(s+2)(s+5)}{s(s+1)}\right|_{s=-3}=\frac{-20}{6}=-\frac{10}{3}</span></p>
      <span class="mb">f(t)=\frac{100}{3}-20e^{-t}-\frac{10}{3}e^{-3t}\qquad(t\ge0)</span></div></details>
    <details><summary><span class="q">课上练习：<span class="m">F(s)=\frac{s+2}{s(s+1)}</span>，求 f(t)</span><span class="src">课上练习</span></summary><div class="dbody">
      <p><span class="m">K_1=\left.\frac{s+2}{s+1}\right|_{s=0}=2</span>，<span class="m">K_2=\left.\frac{s+2}{s}\right|_{s=-1}=-1</span></p>
      <span class="mb">f(t)=2-e^{-t}\qquad(t\ge0)</span></div></details>
    <details><summary><span class="q">例 4-10：<span class="m">F(s)=\frac{s^2+3}{(s^2+2s+5)(s+2)}</span>，求 f(t)（含共轭复极点）</span><span class="src">例题</span></summary><div class="dbody">
      <p>极点：<span class="m">-2</span>，以及 <span class="m">-1\pm j2</span>（<span class="m">\alpha=1,\ \beta=2</span>）。</p>
      <p><span class="m">K_0=\left.\frac{s^2+3}{s^2+2s+5}\right|_{s=-2}=\frac{7}{5}</span></p>
      <p><span class="m">K_1=\left.\frac{s^2+3}{(s+2)(s+1+j2)}\right|_{s=-1+j2}=\frac{-j4}{(1+j2)(j4)}=\frac{-1+j2}{5}</span>，即 <span class="m">A=-\frac{1}{5},\ B=\frac{2}{5}</span></p>
      <p>代入 <span class="m">f_c=2e^{-\alpha t}[A\cos\beta t-B\sin\beta t]</span>：</p>
      <span class="mb">f(t)=\frac{7}{5}e^{-2t}-\frac{2}{5}e^{-t}\cos2t-\frac{4}{5}e^{-t}\sin2t\qquad(t\ge0)</span>
      <p class="small muted">检验：<span class="m">f(0)=\frac{7}{5}-\frac{2}{5}=1</span>，与初值定理 <span class="m">\lim_{s\to\infty}sF(s)=1</span> 一致。</p></div></details>
    <details><summary><span class="q">练习（选做）：<span class="m">F(s)=\frac{3}{(s^2+2s+5)(s+2)}</span>，求 f(t)</span><span class="src">选做</span></summary><div class="dbody">
      <p><span class="m">K_0=\left.\frac{3}{s^2+2s+5}\right|_{s=-2}=\frac{3}{5}</span>；<span class="m">K_1=\left.\frac{3}{(s+2)(s+1+j2)}\right|_{s=-1+j2}=\frac{3}{-8+j4}=-0.3-j0.15</span>，即 <span class="m">A=-0.3,\ B=-0.15</span>。</p>
      <span class="mb">f(t)=0.6e^{-2t}-0.6e^{-t}\cos2t+0.3e^{-t}\sin2t\qquad(t\ge0)</span>
      <p class="small muted">检验：<span class="m">f(0)=0</span>，<span class="m">f'(0)=0</span>，与初值定理一致。</p></div></details>

    <h4>求系统响应</h4>
    <details><summary><span class="q">例 1：<span class="m">y''+3y'+2y=u(t)</span>，零初始条件，u 为单位阶跃，求 y(t)</span><span class="src">例题</span></summary><div class="dbody">
      <p>零初始条件下取拉氏变换：<span class="m">(s^2+3s+2)Y(s)=U(s)</span>，所以 <span class="m">\Phi(s)=\frac{1}{s^2+3s+2}=\frac{1}{(s+1)(s+2)}</span>。</p>
      <p><span class="m">Y(s)=\frac{1}{s(s+1)(s+2)}=\frac{1/2}{s}+\frac{-1}{s+1}+\frac{1/2}{s+2}</span></p>
      <span class="mb">y(t)=\frac{1}{2}-e^{-t}+\frac{1}{2}e^{-2t}\qquad(t\ge0)</span>
      <p class="small muted">终值 1/2 也可以用终值定理验证：<span class="m">\lim_{s\to0}sY(s)=\frac{1}{2}</span>。</p></div></details>
    <details><summary><span class="q">作业：<span class="m">y''+3y'+2y=x(t)</span>，输入为单位冲激，求 y(t)</span><span class="src">作业</span></summary><div class="dbody">
      <p><span class="m">X(s)=1</span>，<span class="m">Y(s)=\frac{1}{(s+1)(s+2)}=\frac{1}{s+1}-\frac{1}{s+2}</span></p>
      <span class="mb">y(t)=e^{-t}-e^{-2t}\qquad(t\ge0)</span></div></details>
    <details><summary><span class="q">作业：<span class="m">y''+6y'+8y=x(t)</span>，求 (1) 单位冲激响应；(2) 单位阶跃响应</span><span class="src">作业</span></summary><div class="dbody">
      <p><span class="m">G(s)=\frac{1}{s^2+6s+8}=\frac{1}{(s+2)(s+4)}</span></p>
      <p><strong>(1)</strong> <span class="m">Y(s)=\frac{1}{(s+2)(s+4)}=\frac{1/2}{s+2}-\frac{1/2}{s+4}</span> ⇒ <span class="m">y(t)=\frac{1}{2}\left(e^{-2t}-e^{-4t}\right)</span></p>
      <p><strong>(2)</strong> <span class="m">Y(s)=\frac{1}{s(s+2)(s+4)}=\frac{1/8}{s}-\frac{1/4}{s+2}+\frac{1/8}{s+4}</span> ⇒ <span class="m">y(t)=\frac{1}{8}-\frac{1}{4}e^{-2t}+\frac{1}{8}e^{-4t}</span></p></div></details>
    <details><summary><span class="q">例 2：开环 <span class="m">G(s)=\frac{2}{s^2+3s}</span>，<span class="m">H(s)=1</span>，求单位阶跃响应</span><span class="src">例题</span></summary><div class="dbody">
      <p><span class="m">\Phi(s)=\frac{G}{1+G}=\frac{2}{s^2+3s+2}</span>，<span class="m">Y(s)=\frac{2}{s(s+1)(s+2)}=\frac{1}{s}-\frac{2}{s+1}+\frac{1}{s+2}</span></p>
      <span class="mb">y(t)=1-2e^{-t}+e^{-2t}\qquad(t\ge0)</span></div></details>

    <h4>稳定性</h4>
    <details><summary><span class="q">作业：<span class="m">y''+2y'+3y=r(t)</span>，判断系统稳定性</span><span class="src">作业</span></summary><div class="dbody">
      <p>特征方程 <span class="m">s^2+2s+3=0</span>，<span class="m">p_{1,2}=\frac{-2\pm\sqrt{4-12}}{2}=-1\pm j\sqrt{2}</span>。实部 −1 &lt; 0，<strong>系统稳定</strong>。</p></div></details>

    <h4>结构图化简</h4>
    <details><summary><span class="q">作业：求下图（G₁、G₂ 串联，H 负反馈）的传递函数</span><span class="src">作业 · 课件 P85</span></summary><div class="dbody">
      <p>前向通路 <span class="m">G_1G_2</span>，开环传递函数 <span class="m">G_1G_2H</span>：</p>
      <span class="mb">\frac{C(s)}{R(s)}=\frac{G_1(s)G_2(s)}{1+G_1(s)G_2(s)H(s)}</span></div></details>
    <details><summary><span class="q">作业：G₃ 与 G₁G₂ 并联后串联 G₄，H 负反馈，求传递函数</span><span class="src">作业 · 课件 P86</span></summary><div class="dbody">
      <div class="diagram"><svg viewBox="0 0 640 172" role="img" aria-label="r(t) 经比较点得 e(t)，e(t) 分两路：一路经 G1、G2，一路经 G3，两路在比较点相加后经 G4 得到 c(t)，c(t) 经 H 反馈到第一个比较点。">
        <text x="2" y="85" class="lbl">r(t)</text><line x1="30" y1="80" x2="58" y2="80" class="ln" marker-end="url(#ah)"/>
        <circle cx="70" cy="80" r="12" class="sum"/><text x="52" y="110" class="sg">−</text>
        <line x1="82" y1="80" x2="150" y2="80" class="ln"/><text x="100" y="72" class="lbl">e(t)</text><circle cx="150" cy="80" r="3" class="dotp"/>
        <line x1="150" y1="80" x2="200" y2="80" class="ln" marker-end="url(#ah)"/>
        <rect x="200" y="62" width="80" height="36" rx="4" class="blk"/><text x="240" y="85" text-anchor="middle" class="bt">G₁(s)</text>
        <line x1="280" y1="80" x2="320" y2="80" class="ln" marker-end="url(#ah)"/>
        <rect x="320" y="62" width="80" height="36" rx="4" class="blk"/><text x="360" y="85" text-anchor="middle" class="bt">G₂(s)</text>
        <line x1="400" y1="80" x2="446" y2="80" class="ln" marker-end="url(#ah)"/><text x="424" y="72" class="sg">+</text>
        <polyline points="150,80 150,28 320,28" class="ln" marker-end="url(#ah)"/>
        <rect x="320" y="10" width="80" height="36" rx="4" class="blk"/><text x="360" y="33" text-anchor="middle" class="bt">G₃(s)</text>
        <polyline points="400,28 458,28 458,68" class="ln" marker-end="url(#ah)"/><text x="464" y="58" class="sg">+</text>
        <circle cx="458" cy="80" r="12" class="sum"/>
        <line x1="470" y1="80" x2="510" y2="80" class="ln" marker-end="url(#ah)"/>
        <rect x="510" y="62" width="80" height="36" rx="4" class="blk"/><text x="550" y="85" text-anchor="middle" class="bt">G₄(s)</text>
        <line x1="590" y1="80" x2="636" y2="80" class="ln" marker-end="url(#ah)"/><text x="604" y="72" class="lbl">c(t)</text>
        <circle cx="615" cy="80" r="3" class="dotp"/><polyline points="615,80 615,150 400,150" class="ln" marker-end="url(#ah)"/>
        <rect x="320" y="132" width="80" height="36" rx="4" class="blk"/><text x="360" y="155" text-anchor="middle" class="bt">H(s)</text>
        <polyline points="320,150 70,150 70,92" class="ln" marker-end="url(#ah)"/>
      </svg></div>
      <p><strong>第一步</strong>：<span class="m">G_1,G_2</span> 串联得 <span class="m">G_1G_2</span>，再与 <span class="m">G_3</span> 并联得 <span class="m">G_1G_2+G_3</span>。</p>
      <p><strong>第二步</strong>：与 <span class="m">G_4</span> 串联，前向通路为 <span class="m">(G_1G_2+G_3)G_4</span>。</p>
      <p><strong>第三步</strong>：负反馈公式：</p>
      <span class="mb">\frac{C(s)}{R(s)}=\frac{\left[G_1G_2+G_3\right]G_4}{1+\left[G_1G_2+G_3\right]G_4H}</span>
      <p class="small muted">课件中的变式：如果上方支路是直通（传递函数为 1），反馈为单位反馈，则 <span class="m">\Phi=\frac{[G_1G_2+1]G_4}{1+[G_1G_2+1]G_4}</span>。</p></div></details>

    <h4>小测验讲解</h4>
    <details><summary><span class="q">小测验（4 班）：判稳定性；求稳态误差</span><span class="src">小测验</span></summary><div class="dbody">
      <p><strong>题 1</strong>：<span class="m">y''+y'+y=r</span>。特征根 <span class="m">s=-\frac{1}{2}\pm j\frac{\sqrt3}{2}</span>，实部 &lt; 0，<strong>稳定</strong>。</p>
      <p><strong>题 2</strong>：<span class="m">G(s)=\frac{1}{s^2+5s+5}</span>，单位负反馈，<span class="m">y_d=u(t)</span>，求稳态误差。</p>
      <p><span class="m">\Phi=\frac{G}{1+G}=\frac{1}{s^2+5s+6}</span>，极点 −2、−3，稳定。<span class="m">y(\infty)=\lim_{s\to0}s\cdot\Phi(s)\cdot\frac{1}{s}=\frac{1}{6}</span>，所以 <span class="m">e(\infty)=1-\frac{1}{6}=\frac{5}{6}</span>。</p>
      <p>另一种方法：<span class="m">E(s)=\frac{R(s)}{1+G(s)}</span>，<span class="m">e(\infty)=\frac{1}{1+G(0)}=\frac{1}{1+1/5}=\frac{5}{6}</span>。</p>
      <p><strong>另两题</strong>（连续 PID 的时域、s 域模型；P、I、D 的作用；常用改进型 PID）见 <a href="#c5-hw">第5章作业详解</a>。</p></div></details>
    <details><summary><span class="q">小测验（3 班）：判稳定性；求冲激响应</span><span class="src">小测验</span></summary><div class="dbody">
      <p><strong>题 1</strong>：<span class="m">y''+2y'+3y=r</span>，极点 <span class="m">-1\pm j\sqrt2</span>，<strong>稳定</strong>。</p>
      <p><strong>题 2</strong>：<span class="m">\frac{1}{s}</span> 与 <span class="m">\frac{1}{s+3}</span> 串联，单位负反馈，<span class="m">y_d=\delta(t)</span>，求 y(t)。</p>
      <p>开环 <span class="m">G=\frac{1}{s(s+3)}</span>，闭环 <span class="m">\Phi=\frac{1}{s^2+3s+1}</span>。极点 <span class="m">p_{1,2}=\frac{-3\pm\sqrt5}{2}\approx-0.382,\ -2.618</span>。</p>
      <p><span class="m">Y(s)=\Phi(s)\cdot1=\frac{1}{(s-p_1)(s-p_2)}</span>，<span class="m">K_1=\frac{1}{p_1-p_2}=\frac{1}{\sqrt5}</span>，<span class="m">K_2=-\frac{1}{\sqrt5}</span>：</p>
      <span class="mb">y(t)=\frac{1}{\sqrt5}\left(e^{p_1t}-e^{p_2t}\right)\approx0.447\left(e^{-0.382t}-e^{-2.618t}\right)</span>
      <p><strong>另两题</strong>（位置式、增量式数字 PID；P/I/D 的作用；两种改进型）见 <a href="#c5-hw">第5章</a>。</p></div></details>
  </section>
</section>
<!-- ================= 第5章 ================= -->
<section class="chapter" id="c5">
  <div class="chapter-head"><div class="num">CHAPTER 5</div><h2>第5章 计算机控制算法（PID）</h2><p>第4章解决“分析”问题，本章解决“设计”问题：根据偏差 e(t) 计算控制量 u(t)。</p></div>
  <p style="margin-top:20px">在反馈控制系统中，偏差 <span class="m">e(t)=r(t)-y(t)</span> 送入控制器，控制器输出 <span class="m">u(t)=f[e(t)]</span>。控制器的模型在时域用微分方程描述，在复频域用传递函数描述。</p>
  <div class="diagram"><svg viewBox="0 0 640 172" role="img" aria-label="PID 控制系统结构：偏差 e(t) 同时送入比例 Kp、积分 KI/s、微分 KD s 三个环节，三者输出相加得到 u(t)，作用于被控对象得到 y(t)，y(t) 负反馈到比较点。">
    <text x="2" y="75" class="lbl">r(t)</text><line x1="30" y1="70" x2="56" y2="70" class="ln" marker-end="url(#ah)"/>
    <circle cx="68" cy="70" r="12" cla